9613120494_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qZdun1_uo40Q7kNvwGUrAld&_nc_oc=AdrSWx_Mt3STPd25KhQIraEt_A-0Tgc8cZl9MEJ3jhg8gFgPyLMTyx9L9Jkk6HfJWwM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQcpL3LBdCnYXg9rJ4ZdHtYfhVXI6fkYb3IuaaFTar4jg&oe=6B0DCF1D"}, "display_name": "Singularity VR", "keywords": ["SGVR", "SingularityVR", "ClimberspaceStudios", "singularity"], "long_description": "\nExplore the Singularity.\n\nDeveloped by Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios, Singularity VR is a virtual reality experience designed to push the boundaries of immersive gaming. Whether you are stepping into a virtual world for the first time or you are a seasoned VR veteran, this game delivers a gripping, unforgettable experience built from the ground up for modern VR hardware.\n\nWe wanted to create something that feels as incredible to play as it looks. Through a passionate collaboration between our two studios, we have crafted a world that responds to your every move, drawing you deeper into the gameplay with every session.\n\nKey Features:\n\nBuilt for Immersion: Experience fluid controls, stunning visuals, and a world designed entirely around the unique strengths of virtual reality.\n\nA True Collaboration: Brought to life by the combined creative vision and technical expertise of Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios.\n\nEngaging Gameplay: Engage in competitive movement-based combat, or if you prefer a more relaxed pace, enjoy the atmosphere of Sector 1. Explore the vastness of space to experience true", "short_description": "Step into the Singularity, a collaborative VR experience built for immersion and exploration. Master unique movement mechanics, engage in competitive combat, or drift through the silence of space in stunning Zero-Gravity. Whether you are battling for victory or chilling in Sector 1, your journey into the Singularity awaits. Discover the next step in VR gaming today!"}]}, "developer_